# ============================================================================
# CIRCULO Mobile App — Environment Variables
# ============================================================================
#
# 1. FRONTEND APP CONFIGURATION (.env)
# Copy this file to `.env` to enable Supabase cloud backend integration in Expo.
# Find these values in your Supabase Dashboard -> Project Settings -> API.
#
EXPO_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL=https://your-project-id.supabase.co
EXPO_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=your-supabase-anon-key-here

#
# 2. LOCAL SEED SCRIPT ONLY (.env.local)
# DO NOT put the service_role key into .env or check it into Git!
# To run the local user seeder (`npm run seed`), create a `.env.local` file
# (git-ignored) with:
#
# SUPABASE_URL=https://your-project-id.supabase.co
# SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY=your-supabase-service-role-secret-key-here
#
# ============================================================================
# DUAL-MODE FALLBACK:
# If EXPO_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL is omitted or the network is unreachable,
# CIRCULO automatically activates standalone Demo Mode with local mock personas
# (Priya, Ramesh, Meena, Kavitha, Recycler) without requiring backend connectivity.
# ============================================================================
